Package: RFDose
Type: Package
Title: Deterministic and stochastic radiofrequency electromagnetic field (RF-EMF) dose calculator
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Irina", "Wipf", , "irina.wipf@swisstph.ch", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Package for calculating RF-EMF doses for cohorts. Calculates the
    daily RF-EMF dose of the brain and the whole body from the self-reported use
    of wireless devices and the environment, with SAR values from the GOLIAT
    dosimetric simulations. A stochastic version estimates the uncertainty of the
    doses by drawing the parameters, SAR values and inputs from their
    distributions.
